ype":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場全体のサイリウムも良く見えました...！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な景色をありがとうございましたヽ(；；)丿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"------------------------------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「行くあてのない僕たち」乃木坂46"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はこの曲大好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人の空気感や雰囲気に合ってる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかくかっこいい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\"行くあてのない 僕らの旅は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな結末が待つのだろう？\""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サビの始まりのこの部分が好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一気に盛り上がって行く感じ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イントロも間奏も良い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思わず見ている時一緒に踊ってしまう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分が出てない曲を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見ながらうろ覚えで踊るのが好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/02/23/6119755/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つまみ純奈。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲良し。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ってつまもうとしてるから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしの顔必死すぎる...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":